{"suttaId":"an4.242","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-iv","vriCode":"s0402m3.mul","paras":[1808,1814],"vripara":"242"},"segments":{"an4.242:0.3":"Sappurisānisaṃsasuttaṃ","an4.242:1.1":"“Sappurisaṃ, bhikkhave, nissāya cattāro ānisaṃsā pāṭikaṅkhā.","an4.242:1.2":"Katame cattāro?","an4.242:1.3":"Ariyena sīlena vaḍḍhati, ariyena samādhinā vaḍḍhati, ariyāya paññāya vaḍḍhati, ariyāya vimuttiyā vaḍḍhati – sappurisaṃ, bhikkhave, nissāya ime cattāro ānisaṃsā pāṭikaṅkhā”ti.","an4.242:1.5":"Ekādasamaṃ.","an4.242:1.6":"Kammavaggo catuttho.","an4.242:2.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","an4.242:2.1":"Saṃkhitta vitthāra soṇakāyana,","an4.242:2.2":"Sikkhāpadaṃ ariyamaggo bojjhaṅgaṃ;","an4.242:2.3":"Sāvajjañceva abyābajjhaṃ,","an4.242:2.4":"Samaṇo ca sappurisānisaṃsoti."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
